&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:51pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注１)評価性引当額の変動の主な内容は、繰延税金資産の回収可能性を判断する際の企業分類を変更したことによる税務上の繰越欠損金に係る評価性引当額の減少であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:51pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:51pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注２)税務上の繰越欠損金及びその繰延税金資産の繰越期限別の金額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;前事業年度(&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:45pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
